    "name": "La Vida Hotel",
    "detail": "I can’t begin to express how amazing this hotel is. Literally everything is perfect and even the small things like the shower pressure was strong, beds are firm, toilets are super clean and modern, THE BREAKFAST WAS ABSOLUTELY AMAZING my parents and us LOVED IT and the carpark is super close by (few seconds walk) and the location is walking distance to bubble tea and night market and amazing restaurants for dinner. I WILL DEFINITELY STAY HERE AGAIN. Legit best hotel in Taichung, seriously, and super value for money. We booked 3 rooms for 3 nights for an average price of S$133 per room per night thanks to Agoda discounts. Absolutely happy and can’t thank this place enough! Ideal for families with elderly and adult children and teenagers. Not much places for young children and babies to play but that’s ok for us for now. Thank you once again!!!",
